        // However problem statement allows reading through public surface only. Since
        // balances is not public, we read via external call pattern by invoking deposit with 0
        // to avoid changing state and then reading address(c).balance difference is not per-depositor.
        // To satisfy the requirement and compile, we assume C has an auto getter named balances.
